cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it and the projects it builds on.
  If a source is missing or credited incorrectly, please open an issue in this
  repository so it can be corrected.
title: "QobuzProxy – Device Icons"
abstract: >-
  Fork of QobuzProxy 1.7.6 that adds a per-speaker device type, which sets the
  icon a speaker shows in the Qobuz app.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/5treamer/qobuz-proxy-device-icons"
authors:
  - alias: "5treamer"
  - name: "Claude Code (Anthropic)"
references:
